    Remove dead savestate FSM states (#217)
    
    Remove unused CPU and VDP state declarations and the unreachable VBlank-wait state from the savestate FSM.
    
    Also remove the obsolete vblank_seen tracking logic while preserving all active state values, savestate layout, timing, and behavior.

